Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)

@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "GorillaObstacleNightScene" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :BehaviorAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :actor1 ;
    :hasObstacle :obs1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :night1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .

:actor1 a :Pedestrian ;
    :description "Gorilla moving on the roadway" .

:obs1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Large gorilla occupying the center of the lane" .

:night1 a :NightCondition .

:risk1 a :CollisionRisk ;
    :description "High probability of collision with large animal on road in low light" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 ;
    :confidenceScore "0.95"^^xsd:float .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.95"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Collision risk due to unexpected presence and erratic movement of a large animal on the road in nighttime visibility conditions.
